/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 79 0 R
/E (The tool selection policy chooses the most suitable function for a user query by combining semantic relevance and historical usage. Semantic relevance is measured using embedding similarity between the query and function descriptions, while historical usage is captured through a decayed frequency score. A hybrid strategy selects functions based on similarity first and then reinforces the choice using frequently successful functions, ensuring both accuracy and adaptability.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [14]
